You can also generate QR codes for:

Website URLs (URL QR code);
Personal information vCards (vCard QR code);
Document and digital media files (File QR code);
Social media accounts or pages (Social Media QR code);
A restaurant’s digital menu (Menu QR code);
Promotional or marketing web pages (H5 QR code);
Different landing pages (Multi-URL QR code);
An email address (eMail QR code);
WiFi passcodes (WiFi QR code);
And many more!

